{"id":"f6e6568ea7b179d6","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-finite-hierarchy-values.md","title":"层次的有限级校验","display":"thm-finite-hierarchy-values — 层次的有限级校验","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-finite-hierarchy-values","aliases":["72-thm-finite-hierarchy-values"],"display":"thm-finite-hierarchy-values — 层次的有限级校验","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local derivation from Ch.III Def.2.16; print157–158; PDF169–170","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_status":"locally-derived-from-book-definitions","source_proof_status":"not-a-separate-book-theorem","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-finite-hierarchy-values"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-finite-hierarchy-values</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-hierarchy-values — 层次的有限级校验"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7432b8a48a477c7\" href=\"?note=e7432b8a48a477c7\" title=\"72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy\">72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcd2431dc7fa995d\" href=\"?note=fcd2431dc7fa995d\" title=\"72-df-hardy-hierarchy\">72-df-hardy-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e620b5020310301\" href=\"?note=8e620b5020310301\" title=\"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy\">72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee59458b6acb7c90\" href=\"?note=ee59458b6acb7c90\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic\">72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local derivation from Ch.III Def.2.16; print157–158; PDF169–170"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"locally-derived-from-book-definitions"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-a-separate-book-theorem"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H,B,F\">\\(G,H,B,F\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7432b8a48a477c7\" href=\"?note=e7432b8a48a477c7\" title=\"72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy\">72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fcd2431dc7fa995d\" href=\"?note=fcd2431dc7fa995d\" title=\"72-df-hardy-hierarchy\">72-df-hardy-hierarchy</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8e620b5020310301\" href=\"?note=8e620b5020310301\" title=\"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy\">72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline k\">\\(\\overline k\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ee59458b6acb7c90\" href=\"?note=ee59458b6acb7c90\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic\">72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic</a> 中递归定义的有限树序数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,n\\in\\omega\">\\(k,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_{\\overline k}(n)=k,\\qquad H_{\\overline k}(n)=n+k,\\qquad B_{\\overline k}(n)=n+2^k,\\qquad F_{\\overline1}(n)=2n+1,\\qquad F_{\\overline2}(n)=2^{n+1}(n+1)-1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_{\\overline k}(n)=k,\\qquad H_{\\overline k}(n)=n+k,\\qquad B_{\\overline k}(n)=n+2^k,\\qquad F_{\\overline1}(n)=2n+1,\\qquad F_{\\overline2}(n)=2^{n+1}(n+1)-1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>笔记内证明：前三式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的后继把平移量翻倍。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0\">\\(F_0\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 次迭代给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1(n)=2n+1\">\\(F_1(n)=2n+1\\)</span>；映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto2x+1\">\\(x\\mapsto2x+1\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 次迭代为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^m(x+1)-1\">\\(2^m(x+1)-1\\)</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=n+1\">\\(m=n+1\\)</span> 得最后一式。证明只使用前述递归定义，不声称原书有同编号定理，也不是用有限测试替代一般证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"e7432b8a48a477c7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-hardy-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"fcd2431dc7fa995d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8e620b5020310301","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"ee59458b6acb7c90","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"e7432b8a48a477c7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G,H,B,F$ 分别见 [[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-hardy-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"fcd2431dc7fa995d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G,H,B,F$ 分别见 [[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8e620b5020310301","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G,H,B,F$ 分别见 [[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"ee59458b6acb7c90","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\overline k$ 是 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]] 中递归定义的有限树序数；$k,n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G,H,B,F","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline k","display":false},{"tex":"k,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"G_{\\overline k}(n)=k,\\qquad H_{\\overline k}(n)=n+k,\\qquad B_{\\overline k}(n)=n+2^k,\\qquad F_{\\overline1}(n)=2n+1,\\qquad F_{\\overline2}(n)=2^{n+1}(n+1)-1.","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"F_0","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"F_1(n)=2n+1","display":false},{"tex":"x\\mapsto2x+1","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"2^m(x+1)-1","display":false},{"tex":"m=n+1","display":false}],"bytes":1619,"backlinks":[{"id":"6f6f7533b6b8d306","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-255","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-finite-hierarchy-values|thm-finite-hierarchy-values — 层次的有限级校验]]"}],"outgoing":["e7432b8a48a477c7","fcd2431dc7fa995d","8e620b5020310301","ee59458b6acb7c90"]}